  "freezeRules": [
    "Do not add, remove, rename, or change predefined B3 roles after ontology-stress TaskPacks are authored.",
    "Do not change worker contextRefs, capability scores, matcher weights, or fixed role owners after TaskPack authoring.",
    "The worker pool intentionally contains worker-forensics and worker-external-state, whose context dimensions are not represented by a dedicated predefined B3 role.",
    "B3 may still select any feasible worker through the same matcher; it is not prohibited from using workers lacking a named role.",
    "P and B3 must use the same candidate pool, matcher, model, tools, grader, and one fresh invocation per cell."
  ]
